            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sissymny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious, I didn't have rice vinegar but used white balsamic and eliminated the sugar, good even leftover (without dressing of course). Oh, by-the-way, any kind of toasted nuts would be great on this salad.",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-15T22:55:42.527Z"
